## Re-execute the results

Every result was produced by `datalad containers-run`, so its command, container and inputs are
recorded in the history. Re-execute one with `datalad rerun <commit>`; processing rules are in
`.faire/rules.yaml`, containers in `.faire/containers.yaml`.

